Subject: [PATCH 04/10] FP6: Add script to sort CarrierConfig
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Please keep this script updated
* Update `FIXED_OVERRIDES`, `BASE_ADDITIONS` & `SPECIFIC_OVERRIDES` whenever such changes are made

Before import of an updated vendor.xml from stock

```
❯ python3 sort_carrierconfig.py rro_overlays/CarrierConfigResCommon_Sys/res/xml/vendor.xml old.xml
Successfully processed and saved to old.xml
❯ mv old.xml rro_overlays/CarrierConfigResCommon_Sys/res/xml/vendor.xml
```
Copy new vendor.xml from stock as-is into our vendor.xml and run follow commands

```
❯ python3 sort_carrierconfig.py rro_overlays/CarrierConfigResCommon_Sys/res/xml/vendor.xml new.xml
Successfully processed and saved to new.xml
❯ mv new.xml rro_overlays/CarrierConfigResCommon_Sys/res/xml/vendor.xml
```

